    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit SherryFitz.ie and register for your mySherryFitz account.This traditional, semi-detached bungalow residence date from 1950 and is located in a most mature, leafy setting off O'Brien Road, withing walking distance of all town amenities. The dwelling has been cleverly extended over the years to both its rear and gable sides to now present a generously-proportioned 117m2 of accommodation with a 4 bed 2 bath configuration. Externally, mature surrounding gardens, full vehicular access to rear yard and an array of storage sheds to its rear are sure to appeal. While the entire will benefit from decorative and fixture upgrade, many qualifying for the SEAI grant aid, this home offers massive scope for further development. Viewings are highly advised & invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.14m x 1.59m\nTeak glass-panelled door. Windows front and side. Terracotta tiled floor. Teak hall door and window to hall.\n\nHall - 3.31m x 1.93m\nCarpets. Pine panelled ceiling. Carpets.\n\nSitting Room - 4.80m x 3.33m\nWindow to front. Curtains, pole and blinds. Carpets. Coving. Solid fuel fireplace.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.57m x 3.34m\nDouble Room. Window to front. Curtains, pole and blinds. Carpets. Built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.11m x 3.62m\nWindow to side. Curtains and pole. Carpets.\n\nKitchen - 4.72m x 2.63m\nWindow to rear. Blinds. Marley flooring. Fully fitted floor & wall units. Oven , fan and dishwahser. Open arch to dining area.\n\nDining/ Living area - 4.70mx 3.94m\nWindow to rear. Curtains and pole. Solid fuel stove on marble plinth. Door to inner hall.\n\nRear Hall - 2.00mx 0.99m\nTeak door to rear yard. Marley flooring. Shower room off.\n\nShower Room - 2.60m x 1.54m\nWindow to rear. Blinds. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Toilet, sink and shower cubicle . Aqualisa mains shower. Wall-mounted gas burner.\n\nInner Hall - 1.54m x 0.99m\nCarpets.\n\nBathroom - 1.99m x 1.68m\nWindow to rear. Wet floor shower arrangement . Triton shower, toilet and sink. Wall mirror. Tiled floor. Extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.25m x 3.13m\nDouble room. Window to front. Blinds. Built in wardrobes. Marley flooring.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.71m x 2.09m\nSingle room. Window to rear. Blinds. Carpets.\n\n"
      },
      {
